{"seq":1,"slug":"meeting-standup-english","title":"技术会议与站会英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/meeting-standup-english","wordCount":945,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术会议与站会英语\">技术会议与站会英语</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>会议英语与书面英语的差别在于<strong>它是即时的、有时间预算的</strong>。你只有 30 秒到 2 分钟讲完站会，只有一次机会把话说清。因此会议英语的核心不是&quot;语法漂亮&quot;，而是<strong>用固定模板降低临场思考的压力</strong>，把精力留给信息本身。</p>\n<p>四类会议场景各有自己的固定骨架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>站会</strong>：Yesterday / Today / Blockers 三段式</li>\n<li><strong>Sprint Planning / Retro</strong>：估算与优先级讨论、以及 What went well / What didn&#39;t / Action items 三段反射</li>\n<li><strong>技术讨论</strong>：提出方案、赞同、反对、请求更多时间各有表达梯度</li>\n<li><strong>会议礼仪</strong>：开关场、处理技术故障、时间管理各有套语</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[会议与站会英语] --&gt; B[站会三段式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Planning 与 Retro]&#10;    A --&gt; D[技术讨论句型]&#10;    A --&gt; E[会议礼仪套语]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Yesterday Today Blockers]&#10;    C --&gt; G[估算/优先级 + 肯定/问题/改进]&#10;    D --&gt; H[提出 赞同 反对 求时间]&#10;    E --&gt; I[开关场 技术故障 控时]&#10;    F --&gt; J[简洁 具体 有结构]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[会议与站会英语] --&gt; B[站会三段式]\n    A --&gt; C[Planning 与 Retro]\n    A --&gt; D[技术讨论句型]\n    A --&gt; E[会议礼仪套语]\n    B --&gt; F[Yesterday Today Blockers]\n    C --&gt; G[估算/优先级 + 肯定/问题/改进]\n    D --&gt; H[提出 赞同 反对 求时间]\n    E --&gt; I[开关场 技术故障 控时]\n    F --&gt; J[简洁 具体 有结构]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>贯穿所有场景的三条原则：<strong>简洁</strong>（一句话说一件事）、<strong>具体</strong>（给数字、给 ticket 号、给依赖方）、<strong>有结构</strong>（先给结论再展开）。坚持几周后这些模板会变成肌肉记忆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"daily-standup-的表达模板\">Daily Standup 的表达模板</h2><p>Daily Standup（每日站会）是敏捷团队最高频的英语会议场景。标准的站会发言遵循三段式结构：Yesterday / Today / Blockers。掌握这套模板能让你在 30 秒到 2 分钟内清晰传达工作状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三段式汇报模板\">三段式汇报模板</h3><p><strong>Yesterday（昨天完成的）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Yesterday I finished...&quot;&#10;&quot;I completed the implementation of...&quot;&#10;&quot;I wrapped up the code review for...&quot;&#10;&quot;I managed to get the tests passing for...&quot;&#10;&quot;I spent most of yesterday debugging...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Yesterday I finished...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I completed the implementation of...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I wrapped up the code review for...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I managed to get the tests passing for...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I spent most of yesterday debugging...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Today（今天计划做的）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Today I&#39;m going to work on...&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ll be focusing on...&quot;&#10;&quot;My plan for today is to...&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m picking up the ticket for...&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ll continue working on...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Today I'm going to work on...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll be focusing on...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"My plan for today is to...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm picking up the ticket for...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll continue working on...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Blockers（阻碍/风险）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I&#39;m blocked on X because...&quot;&#10;&quot;I need help with...&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m waiting on Y from the backend team.&quot;&#10;&quot;No blockers at the moment.&quot;&#10;&quot;One potential risk: the third-party API has been flaky.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm blocked on X because...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I need help with...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm waiting on Y from the backend team.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"No blockers at the moment.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"One potential risk: the third-party API has been flaky.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"完整站会发言示例\">完整站会发言示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Hey everyone. Yesterday I finished implementing the password reset flow&#10;and opened a PR — it&#39;s ready for review. Today I&#39;m going to start on&#10;the email verification feature. I&#39;m not blocked, but I have a quick&#10;question about the email template — I&#39;ll ping Sarah after standup.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Hey everyone. Yesterday I finished implementing the password reset flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and opened a PR — it's ready for review. Today I'm going to start on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>the email verification feature. I'm not blocked, but I have a quick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>question about the email template — I'll ping Sarah after standup.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Morning. So yesterday I was mostly debugging the intermittent test&#10;failure in the CI pipeline. Turns out it was a race condition in the&#10;database seeding. I pushed a fix late afternoon. Today I&#39;ll pick up&#10;JIRA-456, the search autocomplete feature. No blockers.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Morning. So yesterday I was mostly debugging the intermittent test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>failure in the CI pipeline. Turns out it was a race condition in the</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>database seeding. I pushed a fix late afternoon. Today I'll pick up</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>JIRA-456, the search autocomplete feature. No blockers.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Hi all. Yesterday I paired with Alex on the caching layer design and&#10;we landed on using Redis with a 5-minute TTL. Today I&#39;ll start the&#10;implementation. One blocker: I need access to the staging Redis cluster.&#10;Could someone from platform help me with that?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Hi all. Yesterday I paired with Alex on the caching layer design and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>we landed on using Redis with a 5-minute TTL. Today I'll start the</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>implementation. One blocker: I need access to the staging Redis cluster.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Could someone from platform help me with that?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"站会表达的常见问题与修正\">站会表达的常见问题与修正</h3><p>同一件事，不同的说法得到的帮助完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见说法</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>更好的说法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;m working on the same thing.&quot;</td>\n<td>信息量为零</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;m finishing the API integration for JIRA-456.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;I have a blocker.&quot;</td>\n<td>没说是什么</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;m blocked on staging access — I need it before I can test the flow.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;It&#39;s almost done.&quot;</td>\n<td>无法判断进度</td>\n<td>&quot;It&#39;s done except for the error handling — I&#39;ll open the PR today.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;ll look into the bug.&quot;</td>\n<td>没有承诺时间</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;ll dig into the intermittent failure this morning and update by EOD.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;Maybe we should discuss later?&quot;</td>\n<td>模糊、无 ownership</td>\n<td>&quot;Can we take this offline? I&#39;ll ping you right after standup.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sprint-planning-会议表达\">Sprint Planning 会议表达</h2><p>Sprint Planning 中需要讨论需求优先级、估算工作量和分配任务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估算讨论\">估算讨论</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I&#39;d estimate this at about 3 story points.&quot;&#10;&quot;This feels like a medium-sized task — maybe 2-3 days of work.&quot;&#10;&quot;I think we&#39;re underestimating the complexity here.&quot;&#10;&quot;Can we break this down into smaller tickets?&quot;&#10;&quot;The main risk is the integration with the external API.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m not confident we can finish this in one sprint.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd estimate this at about 3 story points.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This feels like a medium-sized task — maybe 2-3 days of work.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think we're underestimating the complexity here.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can we break this down into smaller tickets?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The main risk is the integration with the external API.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm not confident we can finish this in one sprint.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"澄清需求\">澄清需求</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Can you clarify what the expected behavior should be when...?&quot;&#10;&quot;What&#39;s the acceptance criteria for this story?&quot;&#10;&quot;Are there any edge cases we should consider?&quot;&#10;&quot;Does this include the mobile responsive view?&quot;&#10;&quot;Who&#39;s the stakeholder we should check with on this?&quot;&#10;&quot;Is there a design spec or mockup for this feature?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can you clarify what the expected behavior should be when...?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"What's the acceptance criteria for this story?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Are there any edge cases we should consider?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Does this include the mobile responsive view?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Who's the stakeholder we should check with on this?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Is there a design spec or mockup for this feature?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"讨论优先级\">讨论优先级</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I think we should prioritize this because...&quot;&#10;&quot;Can we push this to the next sprint?&quot;&#10;&quot;This is a dependency for the checkout feature.&quot;&#10;&quot;Is this a must-have or a nice-to-have?&quot;&#10;&quot;What&#39;s the business impact if we delay this?&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;d suggest we tackle the tech debt ticket first.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think we should prioritize this because...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can we push this to the next sprint?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This is a dependency for the checkout feature.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Is this a must-have or a nice-to-have?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"What's the business impact if we delay this?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd suggest we tackle the tech debt ticket first.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"sprint-retrospective-表达\">Sprint Retrospective 表达</h2><p>回顾会是团队反思改进的重要仪式，通常围绕 &quot;What went well / What didn&#39;t go well / Action items&quot; 展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"肯定成果-what-went-well\">肯定成果（What went well）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;The deployment went really smoothly this sprint.&quot;&#10;&quot;Great collaboration between frontend and backend.&quot;&#10;&quot;I appreciate how quickly the team responded to the incident.&quot;&#10;&quot;The new code review process is really working well.&quot;&#10;&quot;We hit our sprint goal for the first time in three sprints.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"The deployment went really smoothly this sprint.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Great collaboration between frontend and backend.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I appreciate how quickly the team responded to the incident.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The new code review process is really working well.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We hit our sprint goal for the first time in three sprints.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提出问题-what-didn-t-go-well\">提出问题（What didn&#39;t go well）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;We had too many context switches this sprint.&quot;&#10;&quot;The requirements changed mid-sprint, which caused rework.&quot;&#10;&quot;Code reviews are taking too long — PRs sit for days.&quot;&#10;&quot;We underestimated the migration task significantly.&quot;&#10;&quot;Communication between teams could be better.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"We had too many context switches this sprint.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The requirements changed mid-sprint, which caused rework.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Code reviews are taking too long — PRs sit for days.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We underestimated the migration task significantly.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Communication between teams could be better.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提出改进建议-action-items\">提出改进建议（Action items）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I suggest we set a 24-hour SLA for code reviews.&quot;&#10;&quot;Maybe we should have a design review before starting implementation.&quot;&#10;&quot;Can we agree on a no-meeting afternoon for deep work?&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s add a pre-sprint grooming session.&quot;&#10;&quot;How about we rotate the on-call responsibility weekly?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I suggest we set a 24-hour SLA for code reviews.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Maybe we should have a design review before starting implementation.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can we agree on a no-meeting afternoon for deep work?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's add a pre-sprint grooming session.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"How about we rotate the on-call responsibility weekly?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"技术讨论的常用句型\">技术讨论的常用句型</h2><h3 id=\"提出方案\">提出方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;One approach we could take is...&quot;&#10;&quot;What if we tried...&quot;&#10;&quot;Here&#39;s what I&#39;m thinking...&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;d like to propose that we...&quot;&#10;&quot;Have we considered using X for this?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"One approach we could take is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"What if we tried...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Here's what I'm thinking...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd like to propose that we...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Have we considered using X for this?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"表示赞同\">表示赞同</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;That makes a lot of sense.&quot;&#10;&quot;I agree — that&#39;s a solid approach.&quot;&#10;&quot;Yeah, I think that&#39;s the right call.&quot;&#10;&quot;+1 on that.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m on board with this plan.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"That makes a lot of sense.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I agree — that's a solid approach.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Yeah, I think that's the right call.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"+1 on that.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm on board with this plan.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"表示不同意见\">表示不同意见</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I see where you&#39;re coming from, but...&quot;&#10;&quot;I have a slightly different perspective on this.&quot;&#10;&quot;My concern with that approach is...&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s a valid point, but have we considered...?&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m not fully convinced — here&#39;s why...&quot;&#10;&quot;Playing devil&#39;s advocate here — what about...?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I see where you're coming from, but...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I have a slightly different perspective on this.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"My concern with that approach is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's a valid point, but have we considered...?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm not fully convinced — here's why...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Playing devil's advocate here — what about...?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"请求更多时间\">请求更多时间</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Can I take a day to think about this?&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;d like to do a quick spike before committing to an approach.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me prototype this and get back to you tomorrow.&quot;&#10;&quot;I need to do some research before I can give a confident estimate.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can I take a day to think about this?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd like to do a quick spike before committing to an approach.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me prototype this and get back to you tomorrow.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I need to do some research before I can give a confident estimate.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"总结与确认行动项\">总结与确认行动项</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;So to summarize, we agreed on...&quot;&#10;&quot;Just to make sure we&#39;re all on the same page...&quot;&#10;&quot;The action items are: [list]&quot;&#10;&quot;Who&#39;s taking ownership of this?&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s sync on this again next Tuesday.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ll create tickets for the agreed-upon work.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"So to summarize, we agreed on...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Just to make sure we're all on the same page...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The action items are: [list]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Who's taking ownership of this?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's sync on this again next Tuesday.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll create tickets for the agreed-upon work.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"会议礼仪用语\">会议礼仪用语</h2><h3 id=\"开始与结束\">开始与结束</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Shall we get started?&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s jump in.&quot;&#10;&quot;Are we waiting for anyone else?&quot;&#10;&quot;I think that covers everything. Thanks everyone.&quot;&#10;&quot;Good meeting. Let&#39;s call it here.&quot;&#10;&quot;Anything else before we wrap up?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Shall we get started?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's jump in.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Are we waiting for anyone else?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think that covers everything. Thanks everyone.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Good meeting. Let's call it here.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Anything else before we wrap up?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理技术问题\">处理技术问题</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Sorry, you&#39;re cutting out. Could you repeat that?&quot;&#10;&quot;I think you&#39;re on mute.&quot;&#10;&quot;My internet is unstable — can someone take notes for me?&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me share my screen.&quot;&#10;&quot;Can everyone see my screen?&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ll drop the link in the chat.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Sorry, you're cutting out. Could you repeat that?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think you're on mute.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"My internet is unstable — can someone take notes for me?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me share my screen.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can everyone see my screen?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll drop the link in the chat.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"时间管理\">时间管理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;We&#39;re running short on time. Let&#39;s table this for now.&quot;&#10;&quot;Can we take this offline?&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s park this discussion and circle back later.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m mindful of time — can we quickly go through the remaining items?&quot;&#10;&quot;We have 5 minutes left. Any burning topics?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"We're running short on time. Let's table this for now.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Can we take this offline?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's park this discussion and circle back later.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm mindful of time — can we quickly go through the remaining items?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We have 5 minutes left. Any burning topics?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>站会和技术会议的英语不需要完美的语法或华丽的词汇。关键是<strong>简洁</strong>、<strong>具体</strong>、<strong>有结构</strong>。用固定的模板降低临场思考的压力，把精力集中在传达信息本身而非语言组织上。坚持使用这些模板几周后，你会发现这些表达已经变成了肌肉记忆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>会议英语是即时的、有时间预算的，核心是用固定模板降低临场思考压力</li>\n<li>站会遵循 Yesterday / Today / Blockers 三段式，30 秒到 2 分钟讲完</li>\n<li>表达要&quot;简洁 + 具体 + 有结构&quot;：给 ticket 号、依赖方、预计时间，而不是 &quot;almost done&quot;</li>\n<li>Sprint Planning 覆盖估算讨论（story points / 风险）与需求澄清（acceptance criteria / edge cases）</li>\n<li>Retro 围绕 What went well / What didn&#39;t / Action items 三段展开</li>\n<li>技术讨论有提出方案、赞同、反对、请求更多时间四类表达梯度</li>\n<li>会议礼仪套语覆盖开关场、处理技术故障（on mute / cutting out）与时间管理（take it offline）</li>\n<li>关键表达：&quot;blocked on X because...&quot;、&quot;take this offline&quot;、&quot;to summarize, we agreed on...&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术会议与站会英语","id":"技术会议与站会英语"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Daily Standup 的表达模板","id":"daily-standup-的表达模板"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式汇报模板","id":"三段式汇报模板"},{"level":3,"text":"完整站会发言示例","id":"完整站会发言示例"},{"level":3,"text":"站会表达的常见问题与修正","id":"站会表达的常见问题与修正"},{"level":2,"text":"Sprint Planning 会议表达","id":"sprint-planning-会议表达"},{"level":3,"text":"估算讨论","id":"估算讨论"},{"level":3,"text":"澄清需求","id":"澄清需求"},{"level":3,"text":"讨论优先级","id":"讨论优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"Sprint Retrospective 表达","id":"sprint-retrospective-表达"},{"level":3,"text":"肯定成果（What went well）","id":"肯定成果-what-went-well"},{"level":3,"text":"提出问题（What didn't go well）","id":"提出问题-what-didn-t-go-well"},{"level":3,"text":"提出改进建议（Action items）","id":"提出改进建议-action-items"},{"level":2,"text":"技术讨论的常用句型","id":"技术讨论的常用句型"},{"level":3,"text":"提出方案","id":"提出方案"},{"level":3,"text":"表示赞同","id":"表示赞同"},{"level":3,"text":"表示不同意见","id":"表示不同意见"},{"level":3,"text":"请求更多时间","id":"请求更多时间"},{"level":3,"text":"总结与确认行动项","id":"总结与确认行动项"},{"level":2,"text":"会议礼仪用语","id":"会议礼仪用语"},{"level":3,"text":"开始与结束","id":"开始与结束"},{"level":3,"text":"处理技术问题","id":"处理技术问题"},{"level":3,"text":"时间管理","id":"时间管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI Prompt 英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/ai-prompt-english"},"next":{"title":"远程协作沟通英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/remote-collaboration"}}